     {"id": "b", "text": {"en": "b - 3", "te": "b - 3"}, "isCorrect": true},
     {"id": "c", "text": {"en": "b + 3", "te": "b + 3"}, "isCorrect": false},
     {"id": "d", "text": {"en": "3b", "te": "3b"}, "isCorrect": false}],
   "solution": {"en": "Start with b and take 3 away: b - 3.", "te": "b తో మొదలుపెట్టి 3 తీసివేయి: b - 3."},
